  <result aggregation-status="1" type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Output Results</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of sessions of the Council for Innovation and Smart Specialisation</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2021">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Long-standing and firm partnership between UNDP and the Ministry of Economic Development was established with the aim to enhance competitiveness and encourage innovation ecosystem development that stimulates innovation culture, innovation in business and entrepreneurship, through three-fold intervention: 1. strengthening normative framework in the field of innovation, 2. reinforcing institutional framework and 3. implementing and promoting concrete programmes of financial and technical assistance in the field.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional framework in the filed of innovation operational and linked with the Council for innovation and Smart Specialization as the decision making body responsible for implementation of the innovation policies. Secondary legislation (5 bylaws) supporting two main laws adopted and implemented.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation Fund established with defined organizational structure and obligations within innovation ecosystem. Secondary legislation (5 bylaws) supporting two main laws (Law on Innovation Activities and Law on Incentives for Research and Innovation Development ) has been adopted and partially implemented.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacities of the subjects of the innovation ecosystem (Innovation Fund of Montenegro and Science and Technology Park) raised to the level of high operability. Calls for the innovative community published in accordance with the created innovative programs with the support of UNDP. The Technology Transfer Office in Montenegro established as an important part of the innovation ecosystem.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation Fund of Montenegro and Science Technology Park of Montenegro highly operational. Two Innovation Fund instruments were launched (The Innovation Voucher Program and Collaborative Grant Scheme) intended to attract research community and Universities in Montenegro to intensively cooperate with the innovative MSMEs in the country. The analytical study to determine policy needs and gaps for effective technology transfer system in the country, followed with recommendations regarding adequate Technology Transfer Office model, has been produced as to-go structure for the first TTO office in Montenegro.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
